# Styling Guidelines
- Use semantic token classes only (`bg-page`, `bg-card`, `text-text`, `text-muted`, `border-border`, `bg-primary`, etc.).
- Never use hardcoded hex, rgb, or hsl values.
- Never write `dark:` overrides; colors adapt automatically through tokens.
- Layout breakpoints are restricted to `md` (768px) and `xl` (1280px).
- See `docs/ai/styling-and-tokens.md`.
